🚀 Sprint 4 — Environment Setup
Sprint 4 Goal

By the end of this sprint, your computer should be ready to build the real ASTU Stock Management System.

We'll prepare:

Your PC
  │
  ├── Git / GitHub
  ├── VS Code / Kiro
  ├── Node.js + npm
  ├── React + Vite
  ├── Node + Express
  ├── MongoDB
  ├── Environment variables
  └── Project structure

