🧪 Day 1 Practical Task

Open your terminal and run these one at a time:

lsb_release -a
git --version
node --version
npm --version
mongosh --version

Then check Kiro manually.

🧠 Important: Don't install anything yet

This is deliberate.

You might discover:

Git       ✅
Node      ✅
npm       ✅
Kiro      ✅
MongoDB   ❌

That's okay.

We're going to install/configure missing components at the appropriate point in the sprint, rather than randomly installing everything.

This will also teach you an important professional habit:

Before changing a development environment, inspect it first.

